    "title": "Interference Construction of a Perfect Reflection Map from a Fermionic Inverse-Phase Core",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21332867",
    "publication_date": "2026-07-13",
    "description": "This release publishes an additional constructive experiment in which the direct direction-reversal rule used in a previous AB/C complete elastic-reflection simulation is replaced by a local exchange-interference map controlled by the internal phase of a fermionic inverse-phase core. The release includes Japanese and English manuscripts, TeX/PDF builds, the executed numerical script, result JSON/CSV files, figures, and a reproducibility bundle.",
